    <string name="car_data_help">Fuel, battery, coolant and tyre pressures come from NWD\'s Car Info, through the system log; Cockpit never touches the CANBus.\n\nAndroid lets an app read that log only with a permission given once over ADB:\n\nadb shell pm grant %1$s android.permission.READ_LOGS\n\nOn Android 13 and later the system also asks for access to the logs each time the unit starts: allow it.</string>
